            "Forest Fire Spread Simulator\n",
            "0 = Empty, 1 = Tree, 2 = Burning Tree\n",
            "Enter number of rows: 3\n",
            "Enter number of columns: 2\n",
            "Enter the forest grid row by row:\n",
            "12\n",
            "Invalid forest grid.\n"
